WEBVTT

00:36:58.870 --> 00:37:00.463
always stands out here, that,

00:37:00.487 --> 00:37:03.020
"You have to be careful
not to fool yourself,

00:37:03.044 --> 00:37:05.172
and you are the easiest person to fool."

00:37:05.196 --> 00:37:06.520
DF: Yeah, that makes sense,

00:37:06.544 --> 00:37:11.583
and I do have a belief
that we have a more natural disposition

00:37:11.607 --> 00:37:13.890
towards a self or other orientation.

00:37:14.503 --> 00:37:17.796
And then you sort of,
combine that with people's EQ.

00:37:17.820 --> 00:37:21.834
And so if you have a high
self-orientation and a high EQ,

00:37:21.858 --> 00:37:23.851
that makes you kind of dangerous.

00:37:24.279 --> 00:37:27.633
And I think some people are,

00:37:27.657 --> 00:37:29.641
I don't know if the right word is gifted,

00:37:29.665 --> 00:37:32.153
but it's a gift that some people
can use for good,